================================================================================
FUREVER CARE — COMPREHENSIVE PET CARE & WELFARE WEB PLATFORM
System Architecture, Technical Specifications & Verification Documentation
================================================================================

1. PROBLEM DEFINITION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Companion animal care is often hindered by fragmented online information:
- Lack of standardized, life-stage nutritional portioning guidelines.
- Unreliable emergency triage and clinical clinic lookups during acute distress.
- Animal shelters lacking unified portals to showcase adoptable companions.
- Heavy dependencies on complex server infrastructure and third-party APIs that
  fail under offline, low-bandwidth, or file:// browser environments.

FurEver Care resolves this with a 100% static, client-side, zero-latency multi-page
system containing dedicated portals for Pet Owners, Veterinarians, and Animal Shelters.


2. DESIGN & TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Architecture: Static Multi-Page Architecture (MPA) across 15 responsive HTML pages.
* Styling: Pure responsive CSS using standard custom design tokens (Warm Forest Theme).
* Primary Colors: Forest Pine (#2D6A4F), Hunter Green (#1B4332), Coral (#E76F51).
* Typography: Playfair Display (Headings) paired with Plus Jakarta Sans (Body & Controls).
* Breakpoints: Mobile (360px-767px), Tablet (768px-1023px), Desktop (1024px+).
* Zero-Fetch Guarantee: All data models reside in /data/*.js and load via <script> tags.


3. USER & SYSTEM FLOWS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Landing & Role Selection: User visits index.html and selects their identity.
2. Pet Profile Customization: User creates/edits companion profile in pet-profile.html.
3. Dashboard Personalization: pet-owner.html reflects companion name & passport details.
4. Nutrition Engine: User calculates portion in feeding-guide.html and reads charts.
5. Multimodal Audio/Video: Grooming modal playback and Speech Synthesis audio guides.


4. DATA FLOW DIAGRAM (DFD) OVERVIEW
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[User Action] ---> [HTML5 UI Form / Button Trigger]
                         |
                         v
            [js/script.js Orchestration Engine]
              |                   |                  |
              v                   v                  v
     [LocalStorage Cache]   [Static Data Stores]  [DOM Render Engine]
     - Saved Pet Profile    - FUREVER_PRODUCTS    - Live Tables
     - User Role & Name     - FUREVER_PETS        - Audio Players
     - Visitor Counter      - FUREVER_VETS        - Modals & Badges


