6. EXECUTION INSTRUCTIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A. Direct Browser: Double click index.html (works via file:// protocol).
B. Dev Server: Run 'npm run dev' and open http://localhost:3000 in your browser.
C. Production Build: Run 'npm run build' to generate the dist/ output.


7. RESOLVED ISSUES & ERROR RESOLUTION LOG
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[FIXED] BUG-001: Video playback failure on grooming masterclasses page.
  - Linked all 6 dedicated masterclass MP4 video files with custom playback
    controls (Play/Pause, seek timeline, volume, speed selector, fullscreen).

[FIXED] BUG-002: Blurry dark box & faint semi-transparent overlay on preview cards.
  - Removed opaque background fills and backdrop blur from .video-play-overlay.
  - Positioned clean floating play button with clear high-resolution thumbnails.

[FIXED] BUG-003: Navigation & Footer link divergence across secondary templates.
  - Standardized the 4-column responsive footer across all 19 HTML templates.

[FIXED] BUG-004: SEO, Open Graph metadata, and favicon consistency.
  - Added complete Open Graph tags, keywords, author, and theme-color tags.

[FIXED] BUG-005: Video completion progress tracking and persistence.
  - Added watch completion tracking with localStorage persistence and badges.

[FIXED] BUG-006: Hero section dark mode gradient obscuring text legibility.
  - Tuned dark mode ambient gradients (emerald & subtle peach over deep dark canvas).
  - Enhanced text brightness (#FFFFFF headline, #72C39B accent, #D3E0D8 body lead).
  - Elevated section badges and carousel caption cards with high-contrast surfaces.

